*[[:en:Rangjung Dorje, 3rd Karmapa Lama|Rangjung Dorje, 3rd Karmapa Lama]]  (1284–1339) – ''Aspiration Prayer of Mahāmudrā''{{sfnp|Rangjung Dorje|n.d.}} 
*{{ill|Khedrup Gelek Pelzang, 1st Panchen Lama|en|Khedrup Gelek Pelzang, 1st Panchen Lama|qid=Q1366437|lt=Khedrup Gelek Pelzang, 1st Panchen Lama|1=Khedrup Gelek Pelzang, 1st Panchen Lama}} (1385–1438 CE) –  ''A Root Text for the Precious Gelug/Kagyü Tradition of Mahamudra''
*[[Gyalwang Kunga Rinchen]] (1475–1527)  – ''Clarifying the Jewel Rosary of the Fivefold Profound Path''
*{{ill|Lobsang Chökyi Gyaltsen, 4th Panchen Lama|en|Lobsang Chökyi Gyaltsen, 4th Panchen Lama|qid=Q930398|lt=Lobsang Chökyi Gyaltsen, 4th Panchen Lama|1=Lobsang Chökyi Gyaltsen, 4th Panchen Lama}} (1570–1662) – ''Highway of the Conquerors''{{sfnp|Panchen Lama|n.d.}} 
